<title>JAPAN: Nippon Trust's loans to Tada may be uncollectable.</title>
<headline>Nippon Trust's loans to Tada may be uncollectable.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Trust Bank said on Wedneday that its loans of 25.6 billion yen to Tada Corp may become uncollectable.</p>
<p>Tada Corp, a major Japanese construction company, announced on Wednesday it filed for court protection with debts totalling 171.4 billion yen.</p>
<p>Tada also said that its debts had exceeded its assets by more than 30 billion yen as of March 31.</p>
